for any $\tau \in \mathcal{T}$ and $F \in \mathcal{F}^\varnothing_N$ and write $\langle \cdot, \cdot \rangle$ for the Frobenius inner product of two matrices. $N, \, \mathcal{T}, \, (\{c_{i, F}^\tau \mid 1 \leq i \leq | \mathcal{F}^\tau_{\ell_\tau}|, F \in \mathcal{F}^\tau_{\ell_\tau} \} )_{\tau \in \mathcal{T}}, \, \{ s_F \mid F \in \mathcal{F}_N^\varnothing \}$ now is an SOS certificate if and only if the positive semidefinite matrices

\begin{equation*}
    \mathbb{Q}^{\mathcal{F}^\tau_{\ell_\tau} \times \mathcal{F}^\tau_{\ell_\tau}} \ni Q^\tau = (C^\tau)^\top \cdot C^\tau  \succeq 0,
