    We view the summation in \cref{eq:basic_lower_bound} as a degree 2 polynomial over $cr$ variables $x_{j,d}$ corresponding to $G[v,V_j,d]$ ranging over integers subject to the constraints that all variables are $\ge 0$ and that $|V_j| = \sum_{d} x_{j,d}$. Expressed like this, we are trying to lower bound

