\end{equation}
By \cref{lem:exists_cherry_in_Ramsey}, for every color $d\in [c]\setminus \{E(\{u,w\})\}$, the term $G[v,V_w,d]$ occurs in \cref{eq:last_step_lower_bound}. 
We assume that for all $w\in V(E)$ with respectively $u\in V(E)$ we have that, $G[v,V_w,E(\{u,w\})]\ge \frac{7}{8} |V_w|$. Otherwise, we get the lower bound
\begin{equation} \label{eq:tvbLower_4}
